<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes broadly flat.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes broadly flat.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed broadly flat at 477.35/478.25 per dollar in moderate trade, with demand for dollars by corporate clients met by ample Central Bank dollar sales, traders said.</p>
<p>The unit closed Wednesday at 477.35/478.35 per dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;The Central Bank was in the market most of the day and covered dollar needs as they arose,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>((-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
